  <body>

    <div>

      <p begin="00:00.916" end="00:04.413" ttm:agent="v1">Now, I don't think it's just the drugs talking, but</p>

      <p begin="00:04.413" end="00:07.436" ttm:agent="v1">I really think this shit gon' work</p>

      <p begin="00:07.436" end="00:09.002" ttm:agent="v1">What you think</p>

      <p begin="00:09.002" end="00:11.928" ttm:agent="v1">Um, I don't know, it might</p>

      <p begin="00:11.928" end="00:14.946" ttm:agent="v1">Man, I'm tired as ****</p>

      <p begin="00:14.946" end="00:16.446" ttm:agent="v1">But anyways, um</p>

      <p begin="00:16.021" end="00:18.429" ttm:agent="v1">Did you see that video, on instagram?</p>

      <p begin="00:18.429" end="00:19.929" ttm:agent="v1">Man, what video?</p>

      <p begin="00:19.858" end="00:22.518" ttm:agent="v1">It had me dying, but yeah</p>

      <p begin="00:22.518" end="00:24.135" ttm:agent="v1">Don’t think I didn’t see your Chanel shoes</p>

      <p begin="00:24.135" end="00:27.100" ttm:agent="v1">Man, them shit ’s horrible (Hey, hey I think it’ll work)</p>

      <p begin="00:27.100" end="00:29.380" ttm:agent="v1">Did you fall asleep? Uzi!</p>

      <p begin="00:29.380" end="00:32.664" ttm:agent="v1">Of course its gon’ work (And what a lovely morning)</p>

      <p begin="00:32.664" end="00:37.574" ttm:agent="v1">Uzi, wake your ass up</p>

      <p begin="00:37.574" end="00:41.288" ttm:agent="v1">Aye, I told that b !tch I count my cake, b!tch, get out my face</p>

      <p begin="00:41.288" end="00:45.117" ttm:agent="v1">.45 on my waist, boy, get out my way(DP on the beat)\</p>

      <p begin="00:45.117" end="00:48.492" ttm:agent="v1">Goyard on my waist, boy, you ain’t got taste</p>

      <p begin="00:48.492" end="00:51.833" ttm:agent="v1">Now I’m, getting cake, now your b!tch gon’let me</p>

      <p begin="00:51.833" end="00:55.112" ttm:agent="v1">Like oh goddamn,  that’s the b!tch that I want</p>

      <p begin="00:55.112" end="00:58.809" ttm:agent="v1">Oh goddamn, diamonds all on my fronts</p>

      <p begin="00:58.809" end="01:01.925" ttm:agent="v1">At 7AM, I was ****ing your love</p>

      <p begin="01:01.925" end="01:06.471" ttm:agent="v1">11AM，you took that b!tch right to the brunch</p>

      <p begin="01:06.471" end="01:12.224" ttm:agent="v1">Like oh goddamn, that's the b!tch that I want.        Oh goddamn, diamonds all on my fronts</p>

      <p begin="01:12.224" end="01:15.792" ttm:agent="v1">At 7AM, I was ****ing your love</p>

      <p begin="01:15.792" end="01:19.659" ttm:agent="v1">11AM, you took that b!tch right to the brunch</p>

      <p begin="01:19.659" end="01:24.610" ttm:agent="v1">Like oh goddamn, that’s the b!tch that I want</p>

      <p begin="01:24.610" end="01:26.379" ttm:agent="v1">Oh goddamn, diamonds all on my fronts</p>

      <p begin="01:26.379" end="01:29.458" ttm:agent="v1">At 7AM, I was ****ing your love</p>

      <p begin="01:29.458" end="01:33.339" ttm:agent="v1">11AM, you took that b!tch right to the brunch</p>

      <p begin="01:33.339" end="01:36.426" ttm:agent="v1">Like I lost a lot of friends, but who give a ****?</p>

      <p begin="01:36.426" end="01:39.627" ttm:agent="v1">I got the money, now that’s all that I want</p>

      <p begin="01:39.627" end="01:41.711" ttm:agent="v1">She ate me for lunch(Yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:41.711" end="01:43.478" ttm:agent="v1">Feel like 2Pac, I’m a thug(Oh yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:43.478" end="01:45.782" ttm:agent="v1">Know some Crips and Bloods</p>

      <p begin="01:45.782" end="01:47.575" ttm:agent="v1">Xannies, brought them drugs(Oh yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:47.575" end="01:50.570" ttm:agent="v1">Got a lot of people banking on me(Yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:50.570" end="01:54.330" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me my these n!ggas always hating on me(Oh yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:54.330" end="01:57.138" ttm:agent="v1">Coming home, they be waiting on me</p>

      <p begin="01:57.138" end="02:01.429" ttm:agent="v1">Like, jump off my dick, all that faking homies</p>

      <p begin="02:01.429" end="02:04.255" ttm:agent="v1">Like oh goddamn, that’s the b!tch that I want</p>

      <p begin="02:04.255" end="02:07.478" ttm:agent="v1">Oh goddamn, diamonds all on my fronts</p>

      <p begin="02:07.478" end="02:11.107" ttm:agent="v1">At 7AM, I was ****ing your love</p>

      <p begin="02:11.107" end="02:14.384" ttm:agent="v1">11AM，you took that b!tch right to the brunch</p>

      <p begin="02:14.384" end="02:17.824" ttm:agent="v1">Like oh goddamn,  that’s the b!tch that I want</p>

      <p begin="02:17.824" end="02:21.432" ttm:agent="v1">Oh goddamn, diamonds all on my fronts</p>

      <p begin="02:21.432" end="02:24.934" ttm:agent="v1">At 7AM, I was ****ing your love</p>

      <p begin="02:24.934" end="02:28.554" ttm:agent="v1">11AM，you took that b!tch right to the brunch</p>

      <p begin="02:28.554" end="02:31.506" ttm:agent="v1">Like, **** n!gga, like, can you leave me ‘lone?</p>

      <p begin="02:31.506" end="02:35.179" ttm:agent="v1">Made a million by myself, yeah, that be my song</p>

      <p begin="02:35.179" end="02:39.063" ttm:agent="v1">Like, yeah, I rock designer when I’m in my zone</p>

      <p begin="02:39.063" end="02:42.226" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I ****ed your mama, I’m on my VLONE</p>

      <p begin="02:42.226" end="02:45.384" ttm:agent="v1">Said I’m higher than a drone, boy, you is my clone</p>

      <p begin="02:45.384" end="02:48.846" ttm:agent="v1">Your mama a crackhead, I sold that b!tch some stones</p>

      <p begin="02:48.846" end="02:52.666" ttm:agent="v1">Now these b!tches want me, I feel like I’m Mike Jones</p>

      <p begin="02:52.666" end="02:56.372" ttm:agent="v1">281-330-8004</p>

      <p begin="02:56.372" end="02:57.955" ttm:agent="v1">Catch me lean spilling while I’m lane switching</p>

      <p begin="02:57.955" end="02:59.494" ttm:agent="v1">Drop the top, ****ing ceiling</p>

      <p begin="02:59.494" end="03:01.112" ttm:agent="v1">Backwood, propane pilling</p>

      <p begin="03:01.112" end="03:03.397" ttm:agent="v1">Say my name in it, now your chain missing(Lil Uzi)</p>

      <p begin="03:03.397" end="03:04.897" ttm:agent="v1">Had a lot of friends and a lot of homies</p>

      <p begin="03:04.853" end="03:06.649" ttm:agent="v1">Now I’m higher, now they all salty</p>

      <p begin="03:06.649" end="03:08.780" ttm:agent="v1">Tell them n!ggas get the **** up off me</p>

      <p begin="03:08.780" end="03:10.280" ttm:agent="v1">Now I’m higher, now they all salty</p>

      <p begin="03:10.056" end="03:13.223" ttm:agent="v1">Like oh goddamn,  that’s the b!tch that I want</p>

      <p begin="03:13.223" end="03:16.470" ttm:agent="v1">Oh goddamn, diamonds all on my fronts</p>

      <p begin="03:16.470" end="03:20.212" ttm:agent="v1">At 7AM, I was ****ing your love</p>

      <p begin="03:20.212" end="03:23.236" ttm:agent="v1">11AM，you took that b!tch right to the brunch</p>

      <p begin="03:23.236" end="03:26.891" ttm:agent="v1">Like oh goddamn,  that’s the b!tch that I want</p>

      <p begin="03:26.891" end="03:30.281" ttm:agent="v1">Oh goddamn, diamonds all on my fronts</p>

      <p begin="03:30.281" end="03:33.878" ttm:agent="v1">At 7AM, I was ****ing your love</p>

      <p begin="03:33.878" end="03:37.878" ttm:agent="v1">11AM，you took that b!tch right to the brunch, aye</p>

